It works fine for me, on R 3.1.1, on Ubuntu 12.04.5 and Mac. That is, I can load_all(), change the .cpp code, then load_all(), and then run it, and it gives the updated value.

One possibility is that you need to reinstall Rcpp -- and possibly all your other packages. If you run session_info() (from the latest dev version of devtools), it'll show you when all your packages were installed, and on which version of R they were built, and you can see if they are out of date.

-Winston

