Yeah, using the create new project dialog is not currently
recommended.  Fixing it to use devtools::create() is on the to do
list.

Hadley

On Tue, Sep 30, 2014 at 12:00 PM, Josef Fruehwald <jofr...@gmail.com> wrote:
> Resolved the problem. I hadn't set LazyData: true in the description file. I
> guess this is something to take up with RStudio, but starting a new package
> using the New Project>R Package in RStudio doesn't include LazyData: true in
> the description, while devtools::create() does.
>
> -Joe
